; A merge marker is one cost component among others, in either braces:
; bean-check reports each merge and books the cost without it, so {{*}}
; leaves too many numbers missing, as {} would.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B
2020-01-02 * "x"
  Assets:A  1 HOOL {100 USD, *}
  Assets:B
2020-01-03 * "y"
  Assets:A  1 HOOL {*, 100 USD}
  Assets:B
2020-01-04 * "z"
  Assets:A  1 HOOL {{*}}
  Assets:B
